Method & $|\text{Bias}| \downarrow$ & RMSE $\downarrow$ & Coverage $\uparrow$ \\
\midrule
Naive & 0.047 & 0.053 & 0.48 \\
Global & 0.025 & 0.040 & 0.78 \\
HB EC-HTE & \textbf{0.006} & \textbf{0.033} & \textbf{0.90} \\
